pe=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your street food empire by taking on new challenges, offering more menu items, and attracting loyal customers to fuel your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/c9e7a6f2e7661d1c2a0bb25a0fbaf66e.poster.avif?t=1754740381\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/c9e7a6f2e7661d1c2a0bb25a0fbaf66e.webm?t=1754740381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330840/extras/c9e7a6f2e7661d1c2a0bb25a0fbaf66e.mp4?t=1754740381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Food Simulator is developed as Earcly Access game. So there is more to come. We plan make updates in montly period. Key features that we plan to add are: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More local street foods from different countries kitchens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cities and town to discover and grow into.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
